title: "pallet-delegated-staking: reject zero-amount delegations"
doc:
  - audience: Runtime Dev
    description: |
      `delegate_to_agent` now rejects a zero `amount` with `InvalidDelegation`
      instead of persisting a zero-amount `Delegation` record. Previously a
      zero-amount call leaked a provider reference and permanently marked the
      account as a delegator, blocking it from registering as an agent.
crates:
  - name: pallet-delegated-staking
    bump: patch
